<title>USA: Springfield, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</title>
<headline>Springfield, Ky., won by JJB Hilliard.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>JJB Hilliard, WL Lyons, Inc aid it won $1.405 million of Springfield, Ky., water and sewer revenue bonds, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.77 percent.</p>
